    {
      "id": "af97a1f4-c08f-4a16-8def-f25f93f1fe5a",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "csharp",
      "source": "// initializing the predicates\r\nPredicate\u003Cint\u003E isEvenAndDivisableByFive = static x =\u003E (x % 2 == 0) \u0026\u0026 (x % 5 == 0);\r\nisEvenAndDivisableByFive(11)",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "mimeType": "text/plain",
          "content": "False"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "6044f8aa-caae-4a21-a766-6096d93414e3",
      "type": "markdown",
      "source": "### using lambdas with the predicate"
    },
    {
      "id": "e7ada51d-2765-4fe8-8f67-7ffdf2c8ca6c",
      "type": "code",
      "language": "csharp",
      "source": "// A dummy list\r\nList\u003Cint\u003E numbers = new List\u003Cint\u003E(100);\r\nRandom random = new();\r\n// random assignment\r\nfor(int i = 0; i \u003C 100;i\u002B\u002B)\r\n{\r\n    numbers.Add(random.Next(0,1000));\r\n}\r\nnumbers.FindAll(isEvenAndDivisableByFive)",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "mimeType": "text/html",
